{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25867","headline":"灵蛇见少林寺 · 李绅","name":"灵蛇见少林寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琐文结绶灵蛇降，蠖屈螭盘顾视闲。\n鳞蹙翠光抽璀璨，腹连金彩动弯环。\n已应蜕骨风雷後，岂効衔珠草莽间。\n知尔全身护崑阆，不矜挥尾在常山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}